00:10:53,333 --> 00:10:59,333
I See You is a horror, thriller, mystery film directed by Adam Randall.

3
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:26,000
When a 10-year-old boy goes missing, lead investigator Greg Harper struggles to balance
the pressure of the investigation and troubles with his wife, Jackie.

4
00:21:46,666 --> 00:21:52,666
Facing a recent affair, great strain is put on the family that
slowly gnaws away at Jackie's grip on reality.

5
00:27:13,333 --> 00:27:19,333
But after a malicious presence manifests itself in their home and puts their son, Connor, in mortal
danger, the cold, hard truth about evil in the Harper household is finally uncovered.

