01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
I See You is a 2019 American crime horror thriller mystery film
directed by Adam Randall from a screenplay by Devon Graye.

13
01:10:46,666 --> 01:10:52,666
It stars Helen Hunt, Jon Tenney, and Judah Lewis.

14
01:16:13,333 --> 01:16:19,333
Its plot follows the sequence of strange events that begin to happen inside an investigator's
family home after the case of a child who disappeared 15 years ago is reopened.

15
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
It premiered at the 2019 SXSW Film Festival and was released on
December 6, 2019 to generally positive reviews.

16
01:27:06,666 --> 01:27:12,666
The film explores themes of small town, husband wife
relationship, kidnapping, detective, investigation.

17
01:32:33,333 --> 01:32:39,333
The tone is intense and lighthearted and dark.
